<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila elegans Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.8 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The script integrates the Schnakenberg PDE with a spectral Laplacian, builds the Jacobian at (a, b) = (0.12, 0.88), and solves Du so the linear fastest mode is 1.803 µm. The nonlinear lattice that actually emerges has FFT wavelength 1.669 µm, so the operating pattern is not yet the assigned scale." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila elegans Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.8 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 70/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Dispersion goodness-of-fit is real: Pearson r = 0.991 and RMSE = 0.0249 between the continuous growth rate and the 3-point stencil at dx = 0.180 µm, and the nonlinear FFT wavelength (1.669 µm) is reported against 1.803 µm rather than overwritten. The specimen foreground fraction is 1.0, which is a failed leaf test (the leaf has R ≈ G), so the image morphometric in this pass is not usable. No KS statistic and no seed coefficient of variation." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0.py L260–L268: leaf test G > R+18, which classifies this yellow leaf as foreground <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e7f1d7c4b94a5129fd92c9739f2ce6b72bc4ab0f/models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-elegans-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L260-L268>" ;
